    "body": "Releasing claim from Antigravity (m3): blocked before Step 5 test execution and Step 7 gate on this pool runner.\n\nEnvironment blocker while building `camcraft-app` (`flecs_ecs_sys v0.2.1`):\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` (and `cargo check -p flecs_ecs_sys`) failed with exit 101 / `cc-rs` exit status 254.\n- `sccache` errored on `\"/opt/homebrew/bin/sccache\" \"cc\"`: `failed to create directory '/Users/mikekinney/Library/Caches/sccache-pool/preprocessor': Operation not permitted (os error 1)`.\n- `/Users/mikekinney/Library/Caches/sccache-pool` does not exist and cannot be created by `sccache` in this runtime.\n\nOverlap check notes (no PR opened; `assets/posts/tormach-lathe.cps` was not modified):\n- `upstream/main` (`31f8d03`) `g76Why` in `assets/posts/tormach-lathe.cps` still returns the finish-allowance refusal without mentioning regenerating the operation.\n- Open PRs `#1705` and `#1681` touch other functions in `assets/posts/tormach-lathe.cps` and `crates/app/tests/lathe_post_tormach_thread.rs`.\n",
